# StoryRoom - Environment Configuration Template
# Copy this file to .env.local and add your API key.
# Note: StoryRoom includes high-fidelity fallback intelligence, so it runs 100% offline even without an API key!

# Google Gemini API Key (Optional - for live Gemini 2.0 Flash reasoning)
# Obtain your key from: https://aistudio.google.com/
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=your_gemini_api_key_here
